                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "papier-mâché",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e998a72-4a2d-3c6c-856b-917195607c19",
                                        "entry_id": "d79ac12f-3a78-3f8f-8952-5ea7db20eb41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Torn-up paper and other possible materials mixed with paste or glue used to create, when the mass is dried, a durable sculptural object."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72e7b821-7a6d-427e-b54a-b5bfd95019cf",
                                                "sense_id": "6e998a72-4a2d-3c6c-856b-917195607c19",
                                                "text": "She sat completely alone at the very back of the sea-themed restaurant, amid papier-mâché starfish and plastic shrimp."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "papier-mâché",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9429aa5f-1e85-3a08-a8a3-5e6b76296b35",
                                        "entry_id": "457bf38c-1bf5-3611-8095-0adc779748d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To apply papier-mâché to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcdd19a7-315f-4ec0-b744-d3a395a7eb6c",
                                                "sense_id": "9429aa5f-1e85-3a08-a8a3-5e6b76296b35",
                                                "text": "I have had it rebuilt, papier-mâchéd inside and otherwise repaired through the years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "279e61fc-1d75-465b-8034-c34f7850154e",
                                                "sense_id": "9429aa5f-1e85-3a08-a8a3-5e6b76296b35",
                                                "text": "When the bodies of the fish were finished, fins were cut from cardboard to the desired shapes, pinned with straight pins to the fish, and papier-mâchéd in place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a2ba1ad-1669-4813-a41e-6e9583fd41cb",
                                                "sense_id": "9429aa5f-1e85-3a08-a8a3-5e6b76296b35",
                                                "text": "In a giddy moment they had also papier-mâchéd the legs of the card table."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfe81be6-f6b5-4287-9ea8-1791e83c5dcb",
                                                "sense_id": "9429aa5f-1e85-3a08-a8a3-5e6b76296b35",
                                                "text": "I instead constructed ‘shelves’ inside Roy’s stomach, made from mesh, which I then also papier mâchéd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "450ca677-878f-4bea-a063-7262ac1c2304",
                                                "sense_id": "9429aa5f-1e85-3a08-a8a3-5e6b76296b35",
                                                "text": "I papier-mâchéed the entire volcano, constructed the tiny town out of toothpicks, and doublechecked the calculations to make sure it’s all to scale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9e45e66-d204-4f35-ae07-c0b02c40cb17",
                                                "sense_id": "9429aa5f-1e85-3a08-a8a3-5e6b76296b35",
                                                "text": "Then he taped another cardboard tube on and papier-mâchéd it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f315c60d-7ad2-43f5-8789-6285d6b604f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "3790d35a-b47a-3f11-bc14-a0ce797f124f",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8c1829c-4fd1-36d2-9fb1-040d980df666",
                        "source_sense_description": "bouwmateriaal dat gemaakt wordt door papier te vermengen met natte lijm",
                        "target_lang_word": "papier mâché",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "papier mâché",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f28f5803-b7f6-3abd-a2ec-e3f7b58eae35",
                                        "entry_id": "30e0dd2a-6db5-3c70-a59d-dcd8dceac90e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Matériau à base de morceaux de papier assemblés par une colle humide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ffbc30f-ab32-413e-8067-ca7c62914c87",
                                                "sense_id": "f28f5803-b7f6-3abd-a2ec-e3f7b58eae35",
                                                "text": "Lorsque M. de Mériolle eut englouti son filet et sa bouteille, il se frotta les mains avec satisfaction. Maintenant qu’il avait pris des forces, il allait battre ce Parisien en papier mâché."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c71953ff-cbaa-31b7-97b6-cbdaa9a9c0db",
                                        "entry_id": "30e0dd2a-6db5-3c70-a59d-dcd8dceac90e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Aspect blanchâtre, évoquant une mauvaise santé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eebe19f-29ae-45f9-8619-82e975b8d886",
                                                "sense_id": "c71953ff-cbaa-31b7-97b6-cbdaa9a9c0db",
                                                "text": "Figure, visage de papier mâché, visage blême, qui annonce un manque de force ou de santé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d3b8982-bab2-4798-ab75-efb87df8612c",
                                                "sense_id": "c71953ff-cbaa-31b7-97b6-cbdaa9a9c0db",
                                                "text": "C’est un personnage de conte de fées, que Georges Courteline, avec sa petite taille, son teint de papier mâché, ses yeux mobiles, ses paletots aux manches trop longues et sa grosse serviette."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69e9e083-c71b-3d14-9edc-e84629d9ebb5",
                                        "entry_id": "30e0dd2a-6db5-3c70-a59d-dcd8dceac90e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apparence factice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e809591-1a67-4b2e-b919-385af125e291",
                                                "sense_id": "69e9e083-c71b-3d14-9edc-e84629d9ebb5",
                                                "text": "— Vous voulez me quitter, je le vois, dit-elle en hochant la tête. Qui donc vous a donné la force de l’ingratitude, vous qui êtes comme un homme de papier mâché ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fc8178c-8e44-4f4a-9d79-b5e6f469fbe6",
                                                "sense_id": "69e9e083-c71b-3d14-9edc-e84629d9ebb5",
                                                "text": "Jeune avocat de grand talent, orateur remarquable, lettré, habillé à Londres, parlant d’amour en amant, on pouvait prendre cet homme en papier mâché, ce faux-semblant ambulant, pour un être humain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
